 0.2 percentage points compared with the 2009–10 school year.\"}]}, {\"v\": \"surveillance/descriptive\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Results of the school-level reviews are reported to the grantee health department, which then reports aggregated totals to CDC\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"data were weighted based on the estimated size of the population of children in kindergarten\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"All estimates of percentages of children with exemptions are weighted to the number of enrolled children unless otherwise noted.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The median is based on estimates for 49 states and the District of Columbia.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}